      "text": "A photograph of two hands holding a smartphone displaying a Swahili-language data-entry or assessment app screen with a question ('Chunguza mpauko wa kiganja cha mkono') and a selectable option ('Kawaida'); a second basic mobile phone with a green charging cable is visible on the table in the background. Illustrates the AXIS 4 Technology & architecture section.",
